{"speciesId":735,"names":{"fr":"Argouste","es":"Gumshoos","en":"Gumshoos","ja":"デカグース"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Lorsqu’il est sur les traces d’une proie, ce Pokémon n’est pas du genre à abandonner. Sauf le soir, lorsqu’il tombe de sommeil."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Al detectar el rastro de una presa, la acecha con tenacidad, pero al ponerse el sol le vence el sueño."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"When it finds a trace of its prey, it patiently stakes out the location...but it’s always snoozing by nightfall."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"獲物の 痕跡を みつけると 粘り強く その場に 張り込むが 日暮れには うつらうつら している。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Il est accro au goût des Rattata et Rattatac, mais n’en croise pas beaucoup car ceux-ci sont nocturnes. Heureusement, il sait rester patient."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Sus presas favoritas son los Rattata y Raticate, pero, al ser estos diurnos, rara vez se cruza con ellos. La perseverancia es su gran virtud."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"It adores having Rattata and Raticate for dinner, but as it’s diurnal, it never encounters them. This Pokémon boasts incredible patience."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"コラッタや ラッタが 好物なのに 昼行性のため 出会えない。 忍耐強さが 自慢の ポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"À l’origine, on ne le trouvait pas à Alola, mais il y a été introduit il y a bien longtemps pour faire face à la prolifération de Rattata."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"No es autóctono de Alola, sino que se introdujo para paliar la superpoblación de Rattata que se produjo en el pasado."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Although it wasn’t originally found in Alola, this Pokémon was brought over a long time ago when there was a huge Rattata outbreak."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"もともと アローラには いなかったが 昔 コラッタが 大量に 発生したときに 連れて来られた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"D’un naturel très patient, il ne peut toutefois s’empêcher de bondir sur son plat favori, Rattata, s’il en voit un."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Tiene un carácter muy paciente, pero en cuanto avista un Rattata, su manjar predilecto, pierde el control y se lanza sobre él como un poseso."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Patient by nature, this Pokémon loses control of itself and pounces when it spots its favorite meal—Rattata!"},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"とても 我慢強い 性質だが 好物の コラッタを 見つけると 我を 忘れて 飛びかかるぞ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":735,"moves":[{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[18,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[18,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[18,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"sand-attack","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",10],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",10],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[17,"level-up",31],[18,"level-up",31],[25,"level-up",31],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thrash","learns":[[17,"level-up",51],[18,"level-up",51],[25,"level-up",47]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"leer","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",3],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",3],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"bite","learns":[[17,"level-up",19],[18,"level-up",19],[25,"level-up",19]]},{"name":"roar","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"earthquake","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"dig","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"toxic","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-team","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"bide","learns":[[17,"level-up",16],[18,"level-up",16]]},{"name":"rest","learns":[[17,"level-up",55],[17,"machine",0